Viva Questions and Answers
Question	Answer
What is KVM?	Kernel-based Virtual Machine for Linux virtualization.
What is virtualization?	Running multiple operating systems on one machine.
What if output is 0 in vmx/svm check?	Enable virtualization from BIOS.
What if hardware does not support virtualization?	Use VirtualBox or VMware.
What is VT-x?	Intel virtualization technology.
What is AMD-V?	AMD virtualization technology.
What is libvirt?	Virtualization management toolkit.
Command to open VM manager?	virt-manager
Command to check virtualization support?	`egrep -c '(vmx
Difference between VM and container?	VM uses full OS while container shares kernel.
